    "author": "1341788758958608384",
    "displayName": "1341788758958608384",
    "text": "\ud83d\udea8 FRIDAY IS GETTING WEIRD.\nOne stock is flying because of a \ud83d\ude80\nThe other is moving because traders are going CRAZY. \ud83d\udc40\nHere are the 2 names I\u2019m watching:\n\ud83d\ude97 $TSLA \u2014 THE ROADSTER JUST CHANGED THE CONVERSATION.\nTesla unveiled the new Roadster\u2026\nAnd this isn\u2019t just another EV refresh.\n\ud83d\ude80 SpaceX-developed rocket thruster technology\n\u26a1 Insane performance claims\n\ud83d\udd25 Nearly +5% premarket at one point\nThat\u2019s the kind of headline that gets X talking FAST.\nBut I\u2019m not chasing the headline.\nI want to see:\n\ud83d\udcca Volume confirmation\n\ud83c\udfaf Breakout above resistance\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Buyers defending the opening range\nIf Tesla can hold the move, the Roadster story could keep the attention on the stock.\nIf you want to know which names I\u2019m watching BEFORE they start trending\u2026\n\ud83d\udc40 Follow me.\nI\u2019ll keep digging for the setups while everyone else is still catching up. \ud83d\ude80\n#TSLA #HODO #Tesla #Dogecoin #Crypto #StocksToWatch #SmallCaps #StockMarket #DayTrading #TradingSetup",
